{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"docsStarts":1},{"foundation":2,"assurance":3},"/foundation/docs/","/assurance/docs/getting-started/"],"uses":{}},null,{"type":"data","data":[{"docs":1,"source":44},{"nav":2,"slugs":43,"first":6},[3,7,11,15,19,23,27,31,35,39],{"name":4,"href":5,"slug":6},"Getting started","/assurance/docs/getting-started/","getting-started",{"name":8,"href":9,"slug":10},"Scenarios","/assurance/docs/scenarios/","scenarios",{"name":12,"href":13,"slug":14},"Business context","/assurance/docs/business-context/","business-context",{"name":16,"href":17,"slug":18},"Evidence","/assurance/docs/evidence/","evidence",{"name":20,"href":21,"slug":22},"The CLI","/assurance/docs/cli/","cli",{"name":24,"href":25,"slug":26},"Running in CI","/assurance/docs/ci/","ci",{"name":28,"href":29,"slug":30},"Adapters","/assurance/docs/adapters/","adapters",{"name":32,"href":33,"slug":34},"Analyzers","/assurance/docs/analyzers/","analyzers",{"name":36,"href":37,"slug":38},"Privacy","/assurance/docs/privacy/","privacy",{"name":40,"href":41,"slug":42},"Performance","/assurance/docs/performance/","performance",[6,10,14,18,22,26,30,34,38,42],{"repo":45,"version":46},"https://github.com/AHRConsulting/Ahr.Assurance","0.1.0"],"uses":{"params":["product"]}},{"type":"data","data":[{"slug":1,"page":2},"business-context",{"slug":1,"title":3,"html":4,"headings":5,"source":6},"Business context","\u003Cp>A business context names what a group of scenarios protects: its capabilities, the outcomes people expect, the rules that must hold and the risks being guarded against. The report groups journeys by context and shows each outcome, rule and risk with the journeys that cover it.\u003C/p>\n\u003C!-- snippet: business-context -->\n\u003Cpre class=\"code\" data-lang=\"csharp\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">private\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\"> static\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\"> readonly\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-type)\"> BusinessContext\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> _offlineDocuments \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> BusinessContext\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Define\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"offline-document-access\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Offline document access\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Keep documents available when connectivity changes\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Capability\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"read-saved-documents\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Read a saved document without a network\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Outcome\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"saved-content-available\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Saved content is returned to the reader\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Rule\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"offline-does-not-fetch\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Offline reads never contact the web source\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Risk\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"offline-content-missing\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"A returning reader cannot access a saved document\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Reference\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"jira\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"DOC-42\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">new\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-type)\"> Uri\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"https://example.atlassian.net/browse/DOC-42\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">))\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Build\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">();\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>A scenario names its context, and can add references of its own:\u003C/p>\n\u003C!-- snippet: business-scenario -->\n\u003Cpre class=\"code\" data-lang=\"csharp\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> Scenario.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Define\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"A saved document opens without a network\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, _offlineDocuments)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Reference\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"ado\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"1234\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Given\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"A saved document\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> { })\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">When\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"The reader opens it\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> opened \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-literal)\"> true\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Then\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"It opens\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> Assert.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">True\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(opened))\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">VerifyAsync\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">();\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Keep IDs\u003C/strong> when names change.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Declare each context once\u003C/strong> and reuse it across scenarios.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>References\u003C/strong> link to tickets. A context's references apply to every scenario that uses it.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>To leave a context out of a report, list its ID in \u003Ccode>report.excludeContexts\u003C/code> in \u003Ccode>ahr-assurance.json\u003C/code>, or pass \u003Ccode>--exclude-context\u003C/code> to the CLI.\u003C/p>\n",[],"docs/business-context.md"],"uses":{"params":["page","product"]}}]}
